{"n": 514, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "514.webp", "text": "312101 °° +\n\n3031036\n\n3127180 REPLACING BEARING FOR\nFRONT WHEEL\n\nRemove front wheel — see Group 36.\nUnscrew and suspend brake caliper from\nbody on a piece of wire — brake hose\nremains connected.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nUnscrew brake disc and take off grease cap.\nImportant!\n\nAlways replace grease caps.\n\nInstall new grease cap with cement, HWB No.\n81 22 8 407 420.\n\nBreak the collar nut with a cross chisel and\nunscrew with Special Too! 11 2 180.\n\nM3:\n\nSpecial Tool 31 2 080.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace collar nut.\n\nTightening torque”.\n\nLock collar nut.\n\nPull off bearing unit with Special Tools\n\n31 2 101/102/104.\n\nImportant!\n\nA pulled off bearing unit must not be reused.\n\n* See Specifications of Gr. 34\n\neA\n3031039\n\nM3:\n\nPull off bearing unit with Special Tools\n31 2 102/105/106 and wheel bolts (1)\nBearing unit must not be reused.\n\nImportant!\n\nRemove the guard, if the inside bearing inner\nrace (2) remains on the stub axle after pulling\noff the bearing unit.\n\nBend dust guard (1) back and pull off bearing\ninner race (2) with Special Too! 00 7 500 and\nSpecial Tool 33 1 309.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace dust guard (1).", "words": [["312101", 0.1418, 0.939, 0.2016, 0.9602], ["°°", 0.1996, 0.9304, 0.2123, 0.9629], ["+", 0.2249, 0.9443, 0.228, 0.9483], ["3031036", 0.196, 0.9682, 0.2432, 0.9775], ["3127180", 0.2634, 0.069, 0.3131, 0.0822], ["REPLACING", 0.3262, 0.071, 0.3891, 0.0822], ["BEARING", 0.3931, 0.071, 0.4428, 0.0822], ["FOR", 0.4473, 0.071, 0.4691, 0.0822], ["FRONT", 0.3262, 0.0869, 0.3632, 0.0981], ["WHEEL", 0.3673, 0.0862, 0.4053, 0.0981], ["Remove", 0.2639, 0.1187, 0.3024, 0.13], ["front", 0.306, 0.1187, 0.3298, 0.13], ["wheel", 0.3333, 0.1194, 0.3607, 0.13], ["—", 0.3647, 0.124, 0.3718, 0.1267], ["see", 0.3754, 0.122, 0.3896, 0.13], ["Group", 0.3926, 0.118, 0.4235, 0.132], ["36.", 0.4265, 0.1187, 0.4407, 0.13], ["Unscrew", 0.2639, 0.13